HeaderInclude
config/metal/metal-opts.h

; The host driver may pass -m64 when invoking the offload compiler.
; Metal is a 64-bit-only virtual target, so accept -m64 as a no-op for
; compatibility.
m64
Target RejectNegative Mask(ABI64)
Ignored, but accepted for compatibility.  Only 64-bit ABI is supported.

; Metal Shading Language version selection
mmsl=
Target RejectNegative Joined Enum(msl_version) Var(metal_msl_version) Init(MSL_VERSION_2_4)
Specify the Metal Shading Language version.

Enum
Name(msl_version) Type(enum msl_version)

EnumValue
Enum(msl_version) String(2.4) Value(MSL_VERSION_2_4)

EnumValue
Enum(msl_version) String(3.0) Value(MSL_VERSION_3_0)

EnumValue
Enum(msl_version) String(3.1) Value(MSL_VERSION_3_1)
